    NO w (14|w, w<=2000) makes C u {w} tight.  min positive L over these w: 563/105105=0.00535655 at w=84.
    => for EVERY w with 14|w, M(C u {w}) >= 1/14 (transversality holds for this core).

  CORE DROP4 {1..3,5..13} (small meas): meas(G_C)@gap-1/14=97/4004=0.02422577  r=4 arcs  widest=0.007305
