    NO w (14|w, w<=2000) makes C u {w} tight.  min positive L over these w: 893/84084=0.01062033 at w=42.
    => for EVERY w with 14|w, M(C u {w}) >= 1/14 (transversality holds for this core).

  CORE DROP10 {1..9,11..13} (small meas): meas(G_C)@gap-1/14=1520/63063=0.02410288  r=4 arcs  widest=0.006279
    decoupling floor (6/7)meas - r/(7w) > 0  <=>  w > r/(6 meas) = 27.66  -> for w >= 29 (mult of 14) floor>0 => L>0 guaranteed.
    NO w (14|w, w<=2000) makes C u {w} tight.  min positive L over these w: 718/45045=0.01593962 at w=70.
    => for EVERY w with 14|w, M(C u {w}) >= 1/14 (transversality holds for this core).

